      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.6.beta2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta2 - Android 15 (SDK 35 build OS2.0.201.0.VMWINXM) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Adreno (TM) 613 - (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter Build gets completed, aab file is not created (found).\nlikely Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111732#issuecomment-3609633581\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Download Godot 4.5.beta2 and GABE v0.1\n- Download export template and install android build template\n- Do a grable build export with export format AAB\n- See no AAB file is created\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNA",
